                   GRIFFIN'S KEEP

SOMEWHERE IN THE OLD KEEP LIES A GOLDEN EGG.
BRING IT BACK OUT TO THE CLEARING.
TYPE HELP IF YOU ARE STUCK.

A FOREST CLEARING
TALL PINES RING A PATCH OF SUNLIT GRASS.
A PATH LEADS NORTH; WATER SOUNDS FROM THE EAST.
EXITS: NORTH EAST

WHAT NOW? help
MOVE WITH N, S, E, W, U AND D. OTHER WORDS:
LOOK, INVENTORY, TAKE, DROP, UNLOCK, READ, SAY,
QUIT. FOR EXAMPLE: TAKE LAMP

WHAT NOW? n

BEFORE THE KEEP
GREY WALLS RISE ABOVE YOU. AN IRON GATE STANDS
IN THE NORTH WALL.
EXITS: NORTH SOUTH

WHAT NOW? n
THE IRON GATE IS LOCKED.

WHAT NOW? unlock gate
YOU HAVE NO KEY.

WHAT NOW? s

A FOREST CLEARING
TALL PINES RING A PATCH OF SUNLIT GRASS.
A PATH LEADS NORTH; WATER SOUNDS FROM THE EAST.
EXITS: NORTH EAST

WHAT NOW? e

A RIVERBANK
A SLOW BROWN RIVER SLIDES PAST A GRAVEL BANK.
THERE IS AN IRON KEY HERE.
EXITS: WEST

WHAT NOW? take key
TAKEN.

WHAT NOW? take sword
I SEE NO SUCH THING.

WHAT NOW? i
YOU HAVE AN IRON KEY.

WHAT NOW? w

A FOREST CLEARING
TALL PINES RING A PATCH OF SUNLIT GRASS.
A PATH LEADS NORTH; WATER SOUNDS FROM THE EAST.
EXITS: NORTH EAST

WHAT NOW? go north

BEFORE THE KEEP
GREY WALLS RISE ABOVE YOU. AN IRON GATE STANDS
IN THE NORTH WALL.
EXITS: NORTH SOUTH

WHAT NOW? unlock gate
THE KEY TURNS. THE GATE SWINGS OPEN.

WHAT NOW? n

THE GREAT HALL
DUST LIES THICK ON A LONG TABLE. A DOOR LEADS
EAST AND WORN STEPS GO DOWN.
THERE IS A LIT LAMP HERE.
EXITS: SOUTH EAST DOWN

WHAT NOW? down

IT IS PITCH DARK. YOU CAN SEE NOTHING.

WHAT NOW? e
YOU STUMBLE ABOUT IN THE DARK.

WHAT NOW? take egg
IT IS TOO DARK TO FIND ANYTHING.

WHAT NOW? u

THE GREAT HALL
DUST LIES THICK ON A LONG TABLE. A DOOR LEADS
EAST AND WORN STEPS GO DOWN.
THERE IS A LIT LAMP HERE.
EXITS: SOUTH EAST DOWN

WHAT NOW? take lamp
TAKEN.

WHAT NOW? e

THE LIBRARY
SHELVES OF ROTTED BOOKS LINE THE WALLS.
THERE IS A SCROLL HERE.
EXITS: WEST

WHAT NOW? get scroll
TAKEN.

WHAT NOW? read scroll
IN FADED INK: 'THE GRIFFIN SLEEPS WHEN IT HEARS
ITS TRUE NAME, AQUILA.'

WHAT NOW? w

THE GREAT HALL
DUST LIES THICK ON A LONG TABLE. A DOOR LEADS
EAST AND WORN STEPS GO DOWN.
EXITS: SOUTH EAST DOWN

WHAT NOW? d

THE CELLAR
DAMP STONE AND COBWEBS. AN ARCH OPENS EAST.
A GRIFFIN CROUCHES IN THE ARCH, WATCHING YOU.
EXITS: EAST UP

WHAT NOW? e
THE GRIFFIN SNAPS ITS BEAK. YOU JUMP BACK.

WHAT NOW? say hello
YOU SAY 'HELLO'. NOTHING HAPPENS.

WHAT NOW? say aquila
THE GRIFFIN YAWNS, FOLDS ITS WINGS AND SLEEPS.

WHAT NOW? look

THE CELLAR
DAMP STONE AND COBWEBS. AN ARCH OPENS EAST.
A GRIFFIN SLEEPS BESIDE THE ARCH.
EXITS: EAST UP

WHAT NOW? e

THE VAULT
A SMALL ROUND ROOM. THE WALLS GLITTER.
THERE IS A GOLDEN EGG HERE.
EXITS: WEST

WHAT NOW? take egg
TAKEN.

WHAT NOW? inventory
YOU HAVE AN IRON KEY.
YOU HAVE A LIT LAMP.
YOU HAVE A SCROLL.
YOU HAVE A GOLDEN EGG.

WHAT NOW? w

THE CELLAR
DAMP STONE AND COBWEBS. AN ARCH OPENS EAST.
A GRIFFIN SLEEPS BESIDE THE ARCH.
EXITS: EAST UP

WHAT NOW? u

THE GREAT HALL
DUST LIES THICK ON A LONG TABLE. A DOOR LEADS
EAST AND WORN STEPS GO DOWN.
EXITS: SOUTH EAST DOWN

WHAT NOW? s

BEFORE THE KEEP
GREY WALLS RISE ABOVE YOU. AN IRON GATE STANDS
IN THE NORTH WALL.
EXITS: NORTH SOUTH

WHAT NOW? s

YOU STEP INTO THE SUNLIGHT WITH THE GOLDEN EGG.
YOU HAVE WON, IN 34 TURNS.
